{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-02",
  "title": "防衛",
  "storyCode": "0-2",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7fd861b3dcc15510e5826255c8c26d10a57915781d00af65b7da4d41e0dd2a9c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "っはあ、はぁっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "レユニオンの奴ら、なんて勢いだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――おい！　そこの貴様ら、何者だ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "こんな時に、ここで何をしている！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "えっ？　な、何って――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "言いよどむとは、まさか連中のスパイか！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（ウルサス当局に正体を知られたら、面倒なことになる……！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（となれば――）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そちらの憲兵さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……子供……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "っ、貴様……感染者か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そこから動くな！　武器を置け！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……！　（小声）防護の準備を。向こうが敵対姿勢を見せたら、すぐに――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "待て、これは霧か……？　一体どこから……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "お願いです、話を聞いてください！　我々の共通の敵は誰なのか、本当はあなたもよくわかっているはずですよね？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ッ――！　ドーベルマンさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ああ！　――重装オペレーター！　敵襲だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "な、何ッ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……レユニオン……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "アーミヤ、気をつけろ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ほかの連中とは何かが違う。奴は恐らく、相当の実力者だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "フン、逃げ出すか……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "無駄なことを。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "行け。奴らを八つ裂きにしろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "あの動き……部下の練度も相当高いな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "となると、率いる彼女はレユニオンの幹部クラスか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……先ほどから、段々と霧が濃くなってきていますね。この機に乗じて、奇襲を仕掛けてくるかもしれません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "憲兵団のみなさんも、すぐにここから離れてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "退路が断たれる前に離脱しなければ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――断る。行くなら、貴様らだけで行け。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……見逃してやるということだ。さっさと消えるがいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我々は、この場を死守せよと命を受けている。持ち場を離れるわけにはいかんのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……子ウサギよ。貴様のような感染者が、ここを訪れた目的に興味などないが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この街を破壊するために来たのなら、いずれ必ず罰を受けることになる。ウルサスの潰えぬ怒りの炎によって、な。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "しかし、そうでないのなら……ここで起きていることは、貴様らとはなんの関係もないことだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――わかりました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ならば行け。これ以上構っている暇はないのでな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――ウルサス人たる者、敵に背を向けるわけにはいかんのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ありがとう、ございます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "行きましょう、ドーベルマンさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "了解。――総員、第一合流地点へと向かえ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "グズグズするな！　各小隊、速やかに行動せよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来い、感染者ども！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウルサス憲兵隊長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "どうした、突っ立っているだけでは始まらんぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "チェルノボーグのクズ野郎が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "――皆殺しにしてやる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
